    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U06_L02_Q02</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.R.12</p><p>Presentation <strong>Excerpt:</strong> A budget is not a cage; it is a compass. What rhetorical device is used?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
